{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33503","headline":"送从弟归泉州 · 许棠","name":"送从弟归泉州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问省归南服，悬帆任北风。\n何山犹见雪，半路已无鸿。\n瘴杂春云重，星垂夜海空。\n往来如不住，亦是一年中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}